        "## Design review: CHANGES"
      ],
      "reads": [
        "## Test design: PASS",
        "## Build write-up"
      ],
      "summary": {
        "vi": "Review PR ở session riêng, hai lượt (mặc định); Designer so UI với Figma (`--design`)",
        "en": "Two-pass PR review in a separate session (default); Designer compares UI with Figma (`--design`)"
